From 4214ab99927b91a2d3f64c2b0ad73e5f04fcd960 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lmt <lmt@local>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:43:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/17] Keep upstream AI behaviour outside MageZero agents

The base AI is shared by every XMage AI and by the test player, so MageZero's
reworked decisions now apply only when isMageZeroAgent(): choice fallbacks, X
cap, cast-mode order, mode choice, target choice, tie-breaks. Its scoring change
(mana value x100) and dropped harmful-aura rule are reverted to upstream's. The
history hook uses hasEnded(), which has no side effects.

All 105 test classes that failed on the port now pass.
